  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ffaff988667590449a4e442eaed46e5, type: 3}
  m_Name: TutorialNPCDialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueText
  speakerName: Eldrin
  paragraphs:
  - 'Ah, you have finally woken up, traveler. You do not remember much, do you?

'
  - My name is Eldrin.
  - This land has seen better days. Strange creatures have started crawling out of
    the old mine.
  - Before you go rushing in, you will need to get your bearings first.
  - You can find old chests around here, maybe they have something useful for you.
  - "When you are ready, head east. The mine entrance waits\u2026 but tread carefully,
    these monsters are dangerous."
  - Come back to me if you find anything unusual. I will be here, keeping an eye
    on things.
